  Debug-only cleartext exception, so a developer can point the remote at a
  plain-HTTP animator on the LAN (http://<lan-ip>:8003) while testing. It is
  scoped to the debug source set precisely so it can never reach a release APK,
  where an operator token would otherwise be sent over an unencrypted link.
